&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Sans Serif&apos;; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;just to check that the controller component loads and runs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Sans Serif&apos;; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;for a very simple simulation case.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Sans Serif&apos;; font-size:14px;&quot;&gt;For more tests, use the BEV system model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
